<title>LEBANON: Lebanon trade deficit up to $610.8 mln in August.</title>
<headline>Lebanon trade deficit up to $610.8 mln in August.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's trade deficit rose $49 million to $610.8 in August, up $23.4 million from the same period a year earlier, the Bank of Lebanon said in its latest monthly bulletin.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE	Aug 96     July 96	Aug 95</p>
<p>Monthly</p>
<p>    Exports		     88.8	 106.2	  71.6</p>
<p>    Imports		    699.6	 668.0	 659.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -610.8	-561.8	-587.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date</p>
<p>    Exports		    645.4	 556.6	 506.5</p>
<p>    Imports		  4,850.6     4,151.0     4,818.4</p>
<p>    Trade balance	 -4,205.2    -3,594.4    -4,311.9</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 645456</p>
</text>
